WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:03.614
Kikar Hamedina, in the heart of Tel Aviv.

2
00:00:03.614 --> 00:00:08.277
Three towers, and every floor turns 1.25 degrees from the one below.

3
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.093
453 apartments.

4
00:00:11.093 --> 00:00:16.274
Choose a tower, a floor and a direction: here, Tower C, floor 30, north-west.

5
00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:22.390
The view from the window, as modelled, in daylight.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:25.728
Change the time, and watch the light at sunset.

7
00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:29.511
And after dark, the city looks different.

8
00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:33.898
Now step into an example apartment, facing west.

9
00:00:34.151 --> 00:00:37.270
A warm wood finish gives the room a different character.

10
00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:40.533
Or lighter tones, and a more open feel.

11
00:00:40.533 --> 00:00:41.681
Or stone.

12
00:00:41.681 --> 00:00:43.871
Compare finishes before you decide.

13
00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:46.732
On to the lobby, with a security desk.

14
00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:50.290
On a basement level: a pool.

15
00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:53.530
A gym.

16
00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.247
And a spa.

17
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.297
And the underground car park.

18
00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:06.930
Outside: a public park around the towers, with a running track and playgrounds.

19
00:01:07.130 --> 00:01:12.188
And cafés and restaurants nearby, part of life beyond the apartment.
